       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. F10.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-TABLE.
           05 WS-COUNT PIC 9 VALUE 3.
           05 WS-ROW OCCURS 1 TO 5 TIMES
              DEPENDING ON WS-COUNT PIC X(8).
       01 WS-TALLY PIC 9(2) VALUE 0.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           MOVE "AABBAABB" TO WS-ROW(1).
           MOVE "CCCCCCCC" TO WS-ROW(2).
           MOVE "AAAAAAAA" TO WS-ROW(3).

           INSPECT WS-ROW(1) TALLYING WS-TALLY FOR ALL "A".
           DISPLAY "TALLY=" WS-TALLY.

           INSPECT WS-ROW(3) REPLACING ALL "A" BY "Z".
           DISPLAY "ROW3=" WS-ROW(3).
           DISPLAY "COUNT-AFTER=" WS-COUNT.

           MOVE 5 TO WS-COUNT.
           MOVE "AAAABBBB" TO WS-ROW(5).
           INSPECT WS-ROW(5) TALLYING WS-TALLY FOR ALL "A".
           DISPLAY "TALLY2=" WS-TALLY.
           STOP RUN.
